  "prefLabel": "Puc 204.25 Retention of Decisions",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 204.25 Retention of Decisions. The commission shall keep a permanent electronic record of its decisions on file in its records unless the director of the division of records management and archives of the department of state sets a different retention period pursuant to rules adopted under RSA 5:40.\n\nSource. #14184, eff 1-24-25 (formerly Puc 203.34)",
